Z||000012||camon||11-14-2001||01:41 AM||||The tool you need to remove the cig cover (or any other dash screw for that matter) is a "torx" socket. the proper one is "t-15" (I paid like 10.00 for a set that came with 10 different sizes. You can get them almost anywhere (hardware stores, auto part stores and department stores).  <P><BR>Ohh yeah!!!!! i'm also interested in that computer gizmo.<BR>------------------<BR>Keith<p>[This message has been edited by camon (edited 11-14-2001).]||||reg||12
